--- !u!114 &114309757225852158
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1112921726509276}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 352
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 不过对功法的进一步掌握，往往需要大量的时间，所以功法的选择与学习，需要慎之又慎。可以博采众长，但切不可东一榔头西一棒子，到头来一事无成。
  description:
